columns.comment:
Return initial ratings from each team's opening regular-season
game. Missing opening ratings are omitted. Cannot be combined with week;
seasonType must be regular or both when specified. Defaults to false. | API query parameter preseason | rule ratings_elo.week_or_preseason [one_of week, preseason]: without week the API silently returns only the latest available week; give week, or preseason for the opening ratings | rule ratings_elo.preseason_excludes_week [excludes preseason, week if=preseason if_value=true none_of=week]: preseason cannot be combined with week
